  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place yogurt in a small bowl, add water, and whisk until smooth. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, quarter, and core pears; slice lengthwise into thin wedges."
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide pear wedges between plates. Top with yogurt, pumpkin seeds, and cranberries."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, drizzle pear \"nachos\" with honey and enjoy!"
